ent-WeaponRifleSKM24Syndi = sKM-24
    .desc = Cheap and reliable. Enough firepower, little accuracy. Easy to repair, hard to control during sustained fire. Spare option if you lost all your telecrystals at the casino.
ent-WeaponRifleSKM28 = sKM-28
    .desc = A conversion of the standard SKM-24 into a battle rifle with an extended barrel. It offers improved accuracy and stability during bursts. Uses 7.62R ammunition.
ent-WeaponRifleSKM28Nano = XL28
    .desc = An experimental conversion of the Leikha rifle. It has an extended heavy barrel and an integrated optical sight. It offers improved accuracy and effectiveness at long range. Uses .308 rifle ammunition.
ent-WeaponRifleAsh12 = ash-12
    .desc = A heavy automatic rifle chambered in shotgun shells. Hits like a hammer.
